{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L01hbGVmaWNlbnQlMjAlMjgyMDE0JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Maleficent","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/ik8PugpL41s137RAWEGTAWu0dPo.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xjotE7aFdZ0D8aGriYjFOtDayct.jpg","description":"A beautiful, pure-hearted young woman, Maleficent has an idyllic life growing up in a peaceable forest kingdom, until one day when an invading army threatens the harmony of the land. She rises to be the land's fiercest protector, but she ultimately suffers a ruthless betrayal – an act that begins to turn her heart into stone. Bent on revenge, Maleficent faces an epic battle with the invading King's successor and, as a result, places a curse upon his newborn infant Aurora. As the child grows, Maleficent realizes that Aurora holds the key to peace in the kingdom – and to Maleficent's true happiness as well.","releaseInfo":"2014","genres":["Fantasy","Adventure","Action","Family","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.1","runtime":"97 min","cast":["Angelina Jolie","Elle Fanning","Imelda Staunton","Sharlto Copley","Lesley Manville","Juno Temple","Sam Riley","Brenton Thwaites"],"director":["Robert Stromberg"],"released":"2014-05-28T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Don't believe the fairy tale.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Angelina Jolie","character":"Maleficent","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bXNxIKcJ5cNNW8QFrBPWcfTSu9x.jpg"},{"name":"Elle Fanning","character":"Aurora","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ucC5faqfEYVhoC25M6Hi3znZmab.jpg"},{"name":"Imelda Staunton","character":"Knotgrass","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tABRYOHUQeaUCAqrelJV5ZHjl1W.jpg"},{"name":"Sharlto Copley","character":"Stefan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/em89OJJvBRX7kNJJPASmNKQujsC.jpg"},{"name":"Lesley Manville","character":"Flittle","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tioPlSoypjdME3oMu3g7XmgIIKS.jpg"},{"name":"Juno Temple","character":"Thistletwi